WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.450
What happened during the first test?

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.070
It started fine.

3
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:16.330
Okay, Anna. Is your seatbelt buckled?

4
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.210
Yes, sir!

5
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.510
Great. Please start the car.

6
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.550
Okay, Anna, start the car.

7
00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:30.690
Started the car.

8
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:32.170
Good job, Anna.

9
00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.710
Why are you talking to yourself?

10
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.810
I am a little nervous.

11
00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.450
When I'm nervous, I talk to myself.

12
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.230
You don't need to be nervous.

13
00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.250
Listen to that engine!

14
00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:53.650
Please, stop pushing the gas pedal.

15
00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:55.270
Sorry.

16
00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:00.970
Okay, when you are ready, turn.

17
00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.450
Great!

18
00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.890
Not now! You almost hit that car!

19
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:05.550
You said “turn!”

20
00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:08.090
Look first! There were cars in the street.

21
00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:10.490
Please don’t yell at me!

22
00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.290
I’m sorry! I was afraid.

23
00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:14.670
You were yelling.

24
00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.350
Look out for that car! Brake! Brake!!

25
00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.450
Why is everyone honking at us?

26
00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:24.330
You were driving too slow!

27
00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:26.690
Anna, stay on the street!

28
00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:29.950
Hands on the wheel, Anna.

29
00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:32.270
What’s that sound?

30
00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:37.250
That, Anna, is the police.

31
00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.790
That sounds awful.

32
00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.710
Yes, it did not go well.

33
00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:12.450
But, I practiced and passed the second time!

34
00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:18.290
Do you know where you want to take your first drive in Washington, D.C.?

35
00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:21.110
Yes! Let’s go!

36
00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:36.830
There it is … the White House!
